                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.516/283: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-05-12T13:00:00-05:00">May 12, 1934—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>44. Legation’s May 11, 1 p.m. Bank contract signed this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
